  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HyVpPan.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"660\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cwqwNx3TGE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/574476444366012420?label=Discord&amp;color=252a36&amp;labelColor=5865F2&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"></a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mandalacreations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mandalacreations&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;color=252A36&amp;labelColor=FF424D&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF\" width=\"196\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/CesarZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/follow-@cesarzorak-white?label=追蹤&amp;color=252a36&amp;labelColor=1D9BF0&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"213\" height=\"28\"></a></strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>關於：</strong></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></p><p>幻想礦石改進了原版 Minecraft 的礦石，帶來更好的遊戲體驗。<br>靈感來自 Hytale，但融合了我個人的風格。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>特色：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li>3D 礦石。</li>\n<li>3D 黑曜石與哭泣黑曜石。</li>\n<li>3D 紫水晶晶簇。</li>\n</ul><p>如果你想停用「閃亮礦石」效果，請刪除壓縮檔內的「optifine」資料夾。<br>模組支援，點擊這裡：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fantasy-ores-modded-by-cesarzorak\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻想礦石模組版</a> ❤<br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;如果你喜歡我的像素藝術風格，也可以試試：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-perspective\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's - Perspective</a> [相容於多個 Minecraft 版本、其他材質包與模組]<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode/files/4474251\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's - Veganicon</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode/files/4474251\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;快捷列</a> [需手動下載並複製]<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-brewing-guide-on\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's - Brewing Guide On</a> [原版]<br><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's GUI - 深色模式</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-white-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's GUI - 淺色模式</a><br><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fantasy-ores-by-cesarzorak\" rel=\"nofollow\">CesarZorak 的幻想礦石<br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fantasy-ores-modded-by-cesarzorak\" rel=\"nofollow\">CesarZorak 的幻想礦石</a>&nbsp;[模組版]</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4r5WLBc.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"300\"></a><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>💝 親愛的贊助者們 💝</strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><em>請記住，你可以在官方 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mandalacreations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala Creations Patreon</a></span> 上支持我們，那裡會提供即將到來的更新資訊，<br>這能幫助我們為你帶來最佳品質的內容。</em></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EjFOwtq.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"550\"></p>",
